# Optional. Defaults to https://almostlore.com.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://almostlore.com

# Ads. Off by default: with these unset, no ad tags are written and no ad
# request is made. Setting them is not enough to serve ads — that also needs a
# certified consent platform, which is a source change (CONSENT_PLATFORM_INSTALLED
# in lib/ads.ts) and does not exist yet. Use only real values; never invent an ID.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADS_ENABLED=true
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADS_PUBLISHER_ID=ca-pub-0000000000000000
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADS_SLOT=0000000000
